													Dear Admin,</p>
												<p style="font-size: 14px; color: #333333;margin-top: 0px;">
													Please find user Enquiry details below:</p>
												<table border="0" cellpadding="7" cellspacing="0" style="font-size: 14px; color: #333333;font-family: Poppins,sans-serif;line-height: 21px;" width="100%">
